          "en": "The Administrative Division of the Supreme People's Court\nReply on the Request for Instructions Concerning the Application of Document Guofa No. 41 [1994]\nof the State Council and the Relevant Questions\n4 June 1997      Fa Xing Zi No. 6 [1997]\nThe Higher People's Court of Shanxi Province:\nThe request for instructions submitted by your court, Jin Fa Xing Zi No. 1 [1997], has been received. After study, the reply is as follows:\nThe opinion favoured by the judicial committee of your court is agreed with, namely: where an administrative organ for industry and commerce, in accordance with the relevant provisions, intercepts a specific vehicle reported to be transporting counterfeit liquor and provisionally seizes the suspected counterfeit liquor carried thereon, such conduct is not the conduct of setting up checkpoints on the road for inspection expressly prohibited by Document Guofa No. 41 [1994] of the State Council."
