          "en": "Reply of the Supreme People's Procuratorate on How to Calculate the Time Limit for Review for\nProsecution Where Cases concerning the Same Criminal Suspect Suspected of Duty-related Crimes and Other Crimes Are Accepted Successively\n(Adopted at the 108th meeting of the Thirteenth Procuratorial Committee of the Supreme People's Procuratorate on 9 November 2022, promulgated by announcement of the Supreme People's Procuratorate on 15 November 2022, and coming into force on 18 November 2022)\nGao Jian Fa Shi Zi No. 2 [2022]\nJiangsu Provincial People's Procuratorate:\nYour Procuratorate's Request for Instructions on How to Calculate the Time Limit for Review for Prosecution in Interrelated Cases (Su Jian Fa San Bu Zi No. 2 [2022]) has been received. After study, the following reply is given:\nWhere, in a case concerning the same criminal suspect suspected of a duty-related crime and other crimes, the times at which the supervisory organ and the investigating organ transfer the case to the people's procuratorate for review for prosecution are not the same and the cases need to be handled jointly, the time limit for review for prosecution shall be recalculated from the date on which the later case is accepted.\nThis is our reply.\nSupreme People's Procuratorate\n15 November 2022"
